# The rules clew applies, and how much each matters.
#
# Pinned so a change to the set is visible in review rather than only in a
# diff of match arms. `the_rule_pack_matches_its_snapshot` compares it.

invisible-unicode high
opaque-hook medium
download-and-execute high
decode-and-execute high
credential-exfiltration high
unverified-download medium
unpinned-remote-package low
bypass-permissions high
unrestricted-shell medium
trusted-server medium
